entering \[OpenCurlyQuote]Esc + Symbol/Key + Esc\[CloseCurlyQuote]. For \
example, the infinity symbol is obtained by entering \[OpenCurlyQuote]Esc  \
Inf  Esc\[CloseCurlyQuote]:\
\>", "Text",
