Cell["\<\
Any letter entered as input is automatically treated as a variable. No need \
to tell Mathematica explicitly!\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.908960178318646*^9, 
  3.908960244652371*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"db86e516-65b1-4c80-88ad-\
